<!DOCTYPE html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="UTF-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0"><title>Request CareCycle administrative access</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="/defaultEntry.css"><script src="/accessibility.js" defer></script></head><body class="auth-page admin-auth"><a class="skip-link" href="#main-content">Skip to main content</a><main class="auth-shell" id="main-content" tabindex="-1"><section class="auth-story admin-story"><a class="brand brand-light" href="/admin/login"><span class="brand-mark">C</span><span>CareCycle Administration</span></a><div class="story-content"><span class="eyebrow">Approval required</span><h1>Administrative access is never automatic.</h1><p>Your request will be recorded for manual identity and employment verification. It will not create an account or grant privileges.</p></div></section><section class="auth-panel"><div class="auth-card"><span class="eyebrow eyebrow-dark">Access request</span><h2>Request review</h2><p class="auth-subtitle">Use an organizational work email and explain why CareCycle administrative access is required.</p><% if (message) { %><div class="auth-message" role="alert"><%= message %></div><% } %><form action="/admin/access-request" method="post" class="auth-form"><input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<%= csrfToken %>"><label for="name">Full name</label><input id="name" name="name" minlength="2" maxlength="80" required><label for="workEmail">Work email</label><input id="workEmail" type="email" name="workEmail" maxlength="254" required><label for="department">CareCycle team or department</label><input id="department" name="department" minlength="2" maxlength="120" required><label for="justification">Reason for access</label><textarea id="justification" name="justification" minlength="30" maxlength="1000" rows="5" required></textarea><button class="auth-primary" type="submit">Submit access request</button></form><p class="auth-switch"><a href="/admin/login">Return to administration sign in</a></p></div></section></main></body></html>
